WEBVTT

00:08:28.669 --> 00:08:30.992
but I don't require
that anybody else does.

00:08:31.016 --> 00:08:34.682
If your empirical right-left, black-white,

00:08:34.706 --> 00:08:37.596
everything-can-be-explained-by-science
worldview helps you,

00:08:37.620 --> 00:08:40.560
and you can be as creative
as you can possibly be within that,

00:08:40.584 --> 00:08:43.110
and you're generating
an enchanting life through that,

00:08:43.134 --> 00:08:45.491
then you have what I like
to call "not a problem."

00:08:45.515 --> 00:08:50.000
But if it's not working for you,
then come and sit in my room for a minute.

00:08:50.024 --> 00:08:54.563
CA: Certainly this lens gives you
a whole new way to empower people

00:08:54.587 --> 00:08:56.077
to be creative,

00:08:56.101 --> 00:08:58.391
instead of the mantra around creativity,

00:08:58.415 --> 00:09:04.557
a certain, "Be willing to suffer, one;
two, following your passion,